\fs18\fsmilli9240 \cf0 In some circumstances separation of individual star names from "star path" names cannot be resolved. A star may have multiple names 1) if the star is part of numerous star paths and 2) since the naming of stars can differ depending on which Tongan island group it originates from. The nomenclature of stars is approximated based on the limited resources available.
